SUMMARY IN ENGLISH (for reference only; the Spanish text above prevails)
You may use, modify and run this Material in any project, including commercial games, and you may publish your own
derived versions publicly, provided that you: keep this license and the copyright notice; credit "ludokit by
LATINALU" with a link to the original repository; state that your version was modified; and do not present the
original as your own work or as an official version. No warranty. The `terceros/` folder keeps its own MIT license.
